# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DESIGN NOTES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Test suite validates Issue #408 features:
# - Lexer: tokenize source code
# - Parser: build AST from tokens
# - AST: node types (enum_decl, match_expression, pipe_expression)
# - Guards: compile-time evaluation of guard conditions
# - ADT: exhaustiveness checking for match expressions
#
# Many tests are TODO pending full parser implementation.
# Core tests validate: enum parsing, match parsing, pipe parsing,
# guard evaluation, ADT exhaustiveness.
